+
+#### [legal_NER](https://github.com/Legal-NLP-EkStep/legal_NER)
+> **Description:** `legal_NER` is an OpenNyAI component focused on named entity recognition for Indian court judgments. The README explains why generic NER models miss legal entities such as petitioners, respondents, courts, statutes, provisions, and precedents, then packages a domain-specific approach and supporting dataset links. For lawyers or legal ops teams working on case-law corpora, this is useful as a narrow, purpose-built extraction layer instead of a generalist toolkit. **GitHub stats:** 85 stars, Python, Apache-2.0. **Last GitHub activity surfaced during research:** exact commit date was not exposed in the search snippet.
+
