+#### [rhetorical-role-baseline](https://github.com/Legal-NLP-EkStep/rhetorical-role-baseline)
+> **Description:** This OpenNyAI repository provides a benchmark and baseline model for rhetorical role prediction in Indian court judgments. The README explains how judgment sections such as facts, issues, petitioner arguments, respondent arguments, and lower-court rulings can be tagged sentence by sentence to impose structure on otherwise long, messy opinions. For lawyers, that matters because it improves downstream summarization, issue spotting, and explainable retrieval over case law. **GitHub stats:** 43 stars, Python, Apache-2.0. **Last GitHub activity surfaced during research:** exact commit date was not exposed in the search snippet.
+
