+#### [judgment_extractive_summarizer](https://github.com/Legal-NLP-EkStep/judgment_extractive_summarizer)
+> **Description:** This repository targets AI-assisted summarization of Indian court judgments and explicitly frames the problem around headnotes and editorial summarization workflows. The README describes how long judgments can be reduced into extractive summaries to accelerate human legal review while preserving expert oversight. That makes it particularly relevant for publishing, legal research, and case-digest pipelines rather than general-purpose chat. **GitHub stats:** 10 stars, Python, MIT. **Last GitHub activity surfaced during research:** exact commit date was not exposed in the search snippet.
