+### Document Signing and Intake
+
+This category is useful for lawyers, but it is a documented gap for open source AI-native projects. Most strong GitHub repos here are open source e-signature and intake tools rather than deeply AI-driven legal systems.
+
+#### [DocuSeal](https://github.com/docusealco/docuseal)
+> **Description:** DocuSeal is an open source document filling and signing platform positioned as a DocuSign alternative. The README emphasizes PDF field building, multiple submitters, email automation, signature verification, API access, and mobile-friendly signing flows. It is not an AI system by itself, but it is highly relevant to law firms that want self-hosted intake, execution, and signature workflows connected to AI extraction or matter systems. **GitHub stats:** 11.1k stars, Ruby, AGPL-3.0. **Last GitHub activity surfaced during research:** 2025-12-01.
