+### RAG, Search, and Knowledge Assistants
+
+#### [Haystack](https://github.com/deepset-ai/haystack)
+> **Description:** Haystack is a mature orchestration framework for retrieval-augmented generation, semantic search, question answering, and agentic workflows over private data. The README highlights modular pipelines, retrievers, file converters, vector database support, and deployment options. For lawyers, Haystack is most useful when building matter-specific knowledge bases, internal research copilots, or evidence search interfaces where the team wants tight control over retrieval and prompting rather than a closed SaaS assistant. **GitHub stats:** 23.7k stars, MDX as primary GitHub language, Apache-2.0. **Last GitHub activity surfaced during research:** 2026-01-09.
