+> **Description:** Presidio is one of the clearest open source options for detecting, masking, redacting, and anonymizing sensitive data across text, images, and structured data. The README highlights configurable recognizers, multiple languages, image redaction, Docker and Kubernetes deployment, and integration with external models. That makes it directly relevant to lawyers handling client PII, privileged material, intake forms, or production sets that need pre-processing before AI use. **GitHub stats:** 6.5k stars, Python, MIT. **Last GitHub activity surfaced during research:** latest visible release on 2025-09-09.
