+#### [Opennyai](https://github.com/OpenNyAI/Opennyai)
+> **Description:** Opennyai is an opinionated NLP pipeline for Indian legal documents and court judgments. The README centers on unified access to three legal-domain models: named entity recognition, rhetorical role prediction, and extractive summarization. That combination makes it more useful than a generic NLP library when you need explainable building blocks specific to judgments and structured legal text. It is research-forward but still practical for pipelines and experimentation. **GitHub stats:** 87 stars, Python, MIT. **Last GitHub activity surfaced during research:** latest visible release on 2024-05-08.
